Regulator vendors no third-party source. Every dependency is resolved from its
upstream package index at build time and none of it is copied into this tree, so
there is nothing here to attribute beyond the licences of those dependencies.
This section is kept in place because the position is expected to change: the
Phase 2 browser driver ships Playwright, and any code lifted wholesale from a
sibling project (see docs/VENDOR-FROM-STOKER.md) is a vendoring event that must
be recorded here at the time it happens, not reconstructed later.

The open-source dependencies redistributed in the Regulator container images,
and their licences, will be inventoried in licenses/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md once
the image set is stable.
